            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 0,
                    "review_score_desc": "3 user reviews",
                    "total_positive": 3,
                    "total_negative": 0,
                    "total_reviews": 3
                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "41805510",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197971292723",
                            "num_reviews": 1,
                            "playtime_forever": 107,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 100,
                            "last_played": 1527692150
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I think the game has a lot of potential. It has really cute characters, and fun moments. I liked the aesthetic part of the game a lot.\n\nThe best way to describe this game is that it feels like zelda dungeon puzzle, where you move object, traverse to the other area in map, solve the trick,and have the button pressed with the object. Then ta -dah, open the door, goes to next level.  There are magic masks helping you out here and there, but they don't necessarily make your character super strong or something. Masks are integrated as puzzles, and are indispensable tools to solve the problems.  The puzzle itself is a lot less forgiving than zelda, and requires careful and somewhat more creative planning, especially before moving boxes and stuffs around.  I used restart button so many times, that I wished the r indicator on screen is actually just a restart button that makes me go back.\n\nThere is a difficulty spike (at least for me) around meadow 9 something. Forest was breeze compare to later meadow stages. \n\nHighly recommended to those who like careful puzzle games!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1525228714,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1525259004,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 8,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.6276692748069763,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thank you so much for the feedback and support! :)\n \nIf you get stuck or feel yourself restart several times, we suggest to have a top down view to see the entire level first before you take the moves (which you probably already know). This helps a lot when you want to plan where the boxes should go.\n \nAnother useful tip is you can press R to restart the level, so you don't have to hit ESC every time if you want to restart the game.",
